  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Evaluation of the Caritas Bolivia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project covers the evaluation of the previous Caritas Bolivia project cycle (BOL138) and is funded jointly by CAFOD and DKA Austria. The project, Supporting indigenous and campesino organisations in defending their human rights and Creation finished at the end of June 2021 however long delays in contracting the consultant and then due to personal complications suffered by the consultant have delayed the completion of the consultancy. 
The first payment of USD $2750 was covered by DKA and a further payment of USD $2750 is now due from CAFOD as the completed evaluation has been presented.</narrative>
  </description>
